title|The Latter Days
v_from|1
v_to|6
scenes|scene_02_ranch_peace.txt;scene_08_afghanistan_battle.txt
beat|In the latter days the nations of the Earth were troubled by wars and rumors of wars. Describe an ancient city in the desert beyond the mountains of Afghanistan, hidden among old roads and forgotten empires, which had endured many kingdoms. Introduce Lucky, a man of great wealth who had seen much of war and trusted few men, cautious of heart, yet desiring to do what was right. Introduce Astra, a woman fierce in spirit, skilled in things seen and unseen, who perceived patterns others overlooked.

